WEBVTT

00:04.730 --> 00:07.640
Let me hear what your excuse is.

00:08.010 --> 00:10.340
A man who calls himself the Black Knight

00:10.340 --> 00:14.100
is going after all the thieves
in the border province.

00:14.410 --> 00:18.630
Most likely, he was also responsible
for the defeat of the Summoner Unit.

00:20.590 --> 00:21.930
And?

00:21.930 --> 00:24.620
I-I swear to repay him one
day for this dishonor!

00:27.810 --> 00:29.490
You're hopeless.

00:29.490 --> 00:32.290
Have you forgotten that
this is the third time?

00:32.290 --> 00:36.140
Why have you failed to
assassinate one measly girl?

00:38.000 --> 00:40.190
Charlotte Zenfis.

00:40.190 --> 00:44.900
She will no doubt grow to
serve as a threat to me.

00:47.240 --> 00:48.980
The Black Knight.

00:48.980 --> 00:53.760
What a reckless man, trying to get
in the way of the Flash Princess.

00:56.260 --> 01:00.240
Perhaps I should end him with my own hand,

01:00.240 --> 01:03.300
with the holy sword I used
to slay the Demon King.

01:03.300 --> 01:04.240
Hmm?

01:04.240 --> 01:05.700
Wanna fight me, then?

01:05.700 --> 01:06.470
Who goes there?!

01:06.470 --> 01:07.480
Your Majesty!

01:07.480 --> 01:08.760
Please stand back!

01:15.340 --> 01:19.960
The Black Knight has arrived.

01:20.830 --> 01:24.180
There were supposed to be several
layers of barriers mounted.

01:21.640 --> 01:28.020
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

01:21.640 --> 01:28.020
Episode 5

01:21.640 --> 01:28.020
<b>Strongest in the World</b>

01:24.180 --> 01:26.460
How, exactly, did you 
manage to sneak in here?

01:26.460 --> 01:27.510
Barriers?

01:27.510 --> 01:29.970
Oh, you mean those shoddy things?

01:29.970 --> 01:31.580
I just broke through them.

01:31.890 --> 01:36.020
You must be the Black
Knight everyone's talking about.

01:36.020 --> 01:39.000
How dare you get in my way?

01:40.500 --> 01:42.730
Now face the consequences.

01:42.730 --> 01:44.300
<i>Three magic circles in a row?</i>

01:56.040 --> 01:58.630
Just stay there and drown, now.

02:02.490 --> 02:04.210
Be torn from limb to limb!

02:06.170 --> 02:07.550
<i>That's some fast synthesis!</i>

02:09.740 --> 02:10.840
In that case...

02:17.420 --> 02:20.740
I'll burn you to ashes!

02:28.070 --> 02:29.610
That was easy.

02:29.610 --> 02:31.420
So much for the Black Knight.

02:31.890 --> 02:35.440
I see you can use not just that sword,
but multiple elements.

02:35.440 --> 02:36.600
So jealous.

02:37.470 --> 02:40.310
<i>He's unscathed after taking
all of those attacks?</i>

02:40.860 --> 02:43.050
<i>Who in the world </i>is<i> this man?!</i>

02:47.240 --> 02:48.590
<i>What was that just now?</i>

02:48.590 --> 02:52.030
<i>I blocked it instantly,
but I barely sensed its aura!</i>

02:52.030 --> 02:54.470
Hmm. You blocked it, huh?

02:55.290 --> 02:57.230
Time to get serious.

03:05.240 --> 03:07.720
<i>Such enormous mana levels!</i>

03:07.720 --> 03:10.090
<i>I'm going to exhaust my mana!</i>

03:10.090 --> 03:12.980
<i>Not even the Demon King was this powerful!</i>

03:15.950 --> 03:17.840
<i>I'm running out of mana!</i>

03:17.840 --> 03:21.880
<i>Not yet! I still have this sword!</i>

03:49.510 --> 03:53.340
There's no one who can
rival my swordsmanship!

03:53.340 --> 03:56.300
I'm the strongest in the world!

03:57.260 --> 03:58.740
You're the world's strongest?

03:59.400 --> 04:01.100
Nothing to worry about, then.

04:12.240 --> 04:15.290
Now, then, it's time for your punishment.

04:16.070 --> 04:18.550
Wh-What are you...

04:24.370 --> 04:26.710
Wh-What <i>is</i> this?!

04:26.710 --> 04:29.190
What is the meaning of this?!

04:29.610 --> 04:30.740
This thing...

04:30.740 --> 04:33.410
If you attempt to remove it by force, 
say good-bye to your head.

04:35.070 --> 04:36.530
You bastard!

04:36.530 --> 04:40.670
What are you trying to accomplish,
humiliating me in this way?!

04:40.930 --> 04:46.800
Quite frankly, I don't give a crap about
your little schemes or how they turn out.

04:46.800 --> 04:48.660
I have just one demand.

04:49.050 --> 04:55.890
Don't lay a single finger on Margrave Gold
Zenfis, his family, or his province.

04:56.550 --> 05:01.310
That collar will never come off
until I see fit to forgive you.

05:01.880 --> 05:04.640
As for your fate if you defy my demands...

05:05.410 --> 05:06.680
I think you know, right?

05:09.470 --> 05:10.990
We're done here.

05:11.530 --> 05:12.660
Farewell.

05:18.090 --> 05:21.120
This practically makes me a slave!

05:41.890 --> 05:44.360
Good work, my master.

05:44.360 --> 05:47.160
I thought you were being a bit lenient,

05:47.160 --> 05:49.900
but to see the Flash Princess 
in such utter defeat...

05:49.900 --> 05:52.530
It was truly a rare sight to savor.

05:54.730 --> 05:57.650
This should ensure peace for the time being.

05:57.650 --> 05:59.360
But we mustn't let our guard down.

05:59.360 --> 06:01.000
Next time, I won't be as merciful.

06:01.510 --> 06:03.580
I would expect nothing less of my master.

06:03.580 --> 06:07.050
I will eagerly await that day, then.

06:11.260 --> 06:15.720
<b>Five Years Later</b>

06:17.030 --> 06:20.190
Everything is white as
far as the eye can see!

06:20.490 --> 06:25.300
<i>I guess I succeeded in coming off as a
threat in my fight with the Flash Princess.</i>

06:25.300 --> 06:28.770
<i>She hasn't interfered
in matters here ever since.</i>

06:29.480 --> 06:32.460
<i>And so, five years passed uneventfully,</i>

06:32.870 --> 06:35.290
<i>with my fifteenth birthday approaching.</i>

06:36.020 --> 06:39.210
<i>The winters in these northern
lands are harsher than I thought,</i>

06:39.210 --> 06:41.680
<i>and all I want right now is to be in my room!</i>

06:45.480 --> 06:47.880
Haruto, look at this!

06:47.880 --> 06:50.610
I made a transformation brooch!

06:50.610 --> 06:54.340
<i>Unfortunately, Charlotte
 remains an anime otaku.</i>

06:54.340 --> 06:56.550
Impressive, young lady.

06:57.760 --> 07:00.410
In that case, I'll challenge you with this!

07:00.410 --> 07:02.120
Whoa, that's amazing!

07:02.120 --> 07:04.580
It looks just like Father's castle!

07:05.040 --> 07:06.560
<i>That's some insane quality!</i>

07:06.560 --> 07:09.290
<i>She really is so good at
the most worthless things.</i>

07:10.150 --> 07:11.620
Oh, yeah, Flay.

07:11.620 --> 07:13.280
Aren't you cold in that?

07:15.530 --> 07:17.480
What are you saying?

07:17.910 --> 07:21.220
Th-This was the first
outfit that pleased you!

07:21.220 --> 07:23.900
I can't imagine wearing anything else!

07:23.900 --> 07:25.640
<i>In other words, you're a moron.</i>

07:25.640 --> 07:28.560
I was so sure you were resistant to the cold.

07:28.560 --> 07:31.550
This human form sure is inconvenient!

07:31.550 --> 07:34.230
<i>Sheesh, she sure is hopeless.</i>

07:37.220 --> 07:39.420
Isn't that nice, Flay?

07:39.420 --> 07:41.440
Thank you vewy mush...

07:41.440 --> 07:42.240
Listen to me.

07:42.240 --> 07:44.770
The next time you have a problem,
make sure you tell me.

07:45.090 --> 07:46.870
Oh, then I have about ten
things to ask of you...

07:46.870 --> 07:47.590
Denied.

07:47.400 --> 07:48.860
<b>Shock</b>

07:48.850 --> 07:53.350
Haruto, I have something
to ask of you, as well.

07:53.350 --> 07:55.420
S-Sure, what is it?

07:56.710 --> 08:01.170
For this very day, I thought up
a special attack that uses snow!

08:01.170 --> 08:05.200
But sadly, I'm pretty sure I can't use it!

08:05.130 --> 08:06.500
<b>Straightforward</b>

08:06.510 --> 08:09.750
I'm sure you can handle it, though!

08:09.750 --> 08:11.210
So if you would!

08:12.530 --> 08:14.760
<i>I've got a bad feeling about this.</i>

08:14.760 --> 08:16.680
<i>But I can't say no to Char...</i>

08:17.180 --> 08:19.340
So, how do you use it?

08:19.340 --> 08:20.710
Whisper, whisper.

08:21.110 --> 08:22.680
Whisper, whisper, whisper.

08:23.090 --> 08:24.390
Whisper, whisper.

08:23.500 --> 08:25.970
Um, and I need to do that right now?

08:26.280 --> 08:27.120
Yes, please!

08:30.330 --> 08:31.860
Okay.

08:31.860 --> 08:33.590
Hooray!

08:33.590 --> 08:35.400
Why's it always her?!

08:44.000 --> 08:45.600
I'm so excited!

08:47.380 --> 08:50.280
Be stained ever redder by your own blood!

08:50.660 --> 08:52.540
Bloody Iceberg!

08:52.770 --> 08:54.330
<i>So damn embarrassing!</i>

08:54.800 --> 08:56.500
Shatter the earth!

09:04.050 --> 09:06.190
You did it, Haruto!

09:06.190 --> 09:07.730
That was perfect!

09:07.730 --> 09:10.760
Lord Haruto, your powers are mighty indeed.

09:11.230 --> 09:14.220
<i>Man, that was super embarrassing.</i>

09:14.220 --> 09:17.700
<i>But it was worth it to make Char happy, I guess.</i>

09:18.190 --> 09:22.650
<i>Wait, do I get roped into this
sort of thing every time?</i>

09:22.650 --> 09:25.250
Oh, my! What in the world happened here?

09:25.710 --> 09:28.110
Mother! Father!

09:28.110 --> 09:30.510
<i>Wait, Char, you asked both of them to come?!</i>

09:31.160 --> 09:33.960
M-My word!

09:35.350 --> 09:39.260
Oh, no! They'll discover your secret identity!

09:39.260 --> 09:41.430
<i>I'm pretty sure it's too late for that.</i>

09:41.980 --> 09:45.030
<i><i>Oh, whatever. It's all or nothing now.</i></i>

09:45.030 --> 09:46.310
Mom. Dad.

09:47.460 --> 09:49.480
It was all his doing.

09:55.440 --> 09:57.590
He just happened to be passing by,

09:57.590 --> 10:00.400
and he showed us his special attack.

10:04.240 --> 10:07.150
Well, let's leave it at that.

10:16.490 --> 10:19.610
Dad, there haven't been any
incidents lately, right?

10:16.960 --> 10:20.240
Flay, let me help, as well!

10:19.610 --> 10:21.480
No, nothing in particular.

10:21.810 --> 10:24.290
I don't know what happened
to the Queen Consort,

10:24.290 --> 10:27.800
but Charlotte hasn't been
targeted since, to my relief.

10:27.800 --> 10:33.160
What's more, it seems she hasn't appeared
in public for the past few years.

10:33.480 --> 10:37.850
Rumors say that she suddenly
started wearing a slave collar.

10:38.470 --> 10:41.640
At first, it was dismissed as
her eccentric fashion taste,

10:41.640 --> 10:46.690
but now people wonder if she accidentally
put it on and can't take it off.

10:47.090 --> 10:48.200
Or if...

10:48.690 --> 10:51.720
someone deliberately put it on her.

10:53.140 --> 10:55.810
<i>Ah, how peaceful.</i>

10:55.810 --> 10:57.500
<i>No meddling from the Empire,</i>

10:57.170 --> 10:58.810
Oh, you're so talented!

10:57.500 --> 10:59.380
<i>and that woman is staying quiet, as well.</i>

10:59.750 --> 11:00.770
<i>That means one thing.</i>

11:01.210 --> 11:05.290
<i>Now I can finally live a
fulfilling life as a shut-in!</i>

11:05.630 --> 11:06.270
<i>And so...</i>

11:06.270 --> 11:08.150
<i>let's hurry on back to my room!</i>

11:08.470 --> 11:10.530
Oh, that's right, Haruto.

11:10.530 --> 11:13.850
Sorry to say, but you'll attend school in
the royal capital starting this spring.

11:14.110 --> 11:15.230
<b>Freeze</b>

11:15.230 --> 11:16.690
<b>Ghhhhh...</b>

11:16.980 --> 11:17.900
<i>Huh?</i>

11:17.900 --> 11:20.430
<i>That's one hell of a revelation
to drop in the same tone as,</i>

11:20.430 --> 11:22.690
<i>"Hey, can you stop by the convenience store?"</i>

11:22.690 --> 11:24.970
There are complicated factors at play here.

11:25.420 --> 11:28.850
I tried to get you out of it,
but I couldn't refuse.

11:29.340 --> 11:30.910
I'll tell you more about it later.

11:30.910 --> 11:32.090
No way!

11:32.090 --> 11:33.200
Unfortunately...

11:32.560 --> 11:33.800
No way in hell!

11:34.160 --> 11:37.300
<i>And that accursed keyword, "school"!</i>

11:37.300 --> 11:39.620
<i>The place I detested most
in my previous life!</i>

11:39.620 --> 11:41.730
<i>And did he say the royal capital?</i>

11:41.730 --> 11:42.880
<i>You can't be serious!</i>

11:43.750 --> 11:45.210
Are you okay?!

11:45.210 --> 11:49.290
<i>Just when my ideal lifestyle
was within my grasp!</i>

11:49.290 --> 11:51.820
<i>What arduous trial is this?!</i>

11:51.820 --> 11:52.890
Haruto?

11:53.480 --> 11:57.820
Haruto...?

11:53.830 --> 11:57.820
<i>I'm left with no choice but
to set my new mission into action.</i>

11:58.260 --> 12:00.200
<i>Factors that mean I can't refuse?</i>

12:00.200 --> 12:01.850
<i>I'll go and...</i>

12:01.850 --> 12:03.810
<i>crush them myself!</i>

12:03.810 --> 12:07.170
<i>I'm going to hole up in my room,
no matter what it takes!</i>

12:11.580 --> 12:13.000
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

12:14.330 --> 12:15.790
Let me ask you one more time.

12:16.300 --> 12:18.840
Please attend the magic school in
the capital starting this spring!

12:19.050 --> 12:20.090
No way.

12:20.090 --> 12:21.640
That reminds me.

12:21.640 --> 12:26.060
When I tried to make you go to a provincial
school, you were strongly against it.

12:26.490 --> 12:28.380
<i>Well, yeah.</i>

12:28.380 --> 12:32.640
<i>In my past life, that place was nothing
less than a living hell for me.</i>

12:33.240 --> 12:36.470
This time, there's a reason why
you can't just say, "No way."

12:39.520 --> 12:41.210
A recommendation letter?

12:41.210 --> 12:43.680
The king singled me out personally?!

12:44.150 --> 12:47.600
I can't say why the king
has set his eyes on you.

12:47.600 --> 12:51.340
If I had to guess, it would be
because of Princess Marianne.

12:51.700 --> 12:53.030
Princess Marianne?

12:53.290 --> 12:56.530
It seems she took an interest
in you after that tour.

12:56.950 --> 13:00.360
King Jilq loves to dote on the princess.

13:00.360 --> 13:04.790
It being a demand from his beloved
 daughter would explain things.

13:04.790 --> 13:08.550
<i>Wait, why does Marianne want
me to go to that school?</i>

13:08.550 --> 13:13.800
<i>It sounds like an elite school, and I'm
pretty sure I wouldn't survive there.</i>

13:13.800 --> 13:17.880
Prince Laius will be skipping
grades to enroll, as well.

13:17.880 --> 13:18.310
Huh?

13:18.660 --> 13:23.160
"I hope you will study and contribute
to the kingdom's development in tandem."

13:23.160 --> 13:26.710
In other words, he means,
"Please be friends."

13:26.700 --> 13:34.290
Siiiiiigh

13:26.940 --> 13:30.220
<i>Ugh, seriously, what have you done?</i>

13:30.220 --> 13:34.020
<i>Just when I was totally ready
to turn into a shut-in!</i>

13:34.500 --> 13:37.120
I have my concerns, as well.

13:37.560 --> 13:39.710
She may be lying low now,

13:39.710 --> 13:42.280
but it's possible the Queen
Consort is plotting something,

13:42.280 --> 13:45.200
and has goaded on Princess Marianne somehow.

13:46.640 --> 13:50.940
Also, this is purely my personal opinion,

13:50.940 --> 13:54.960
but as your father, I want you to go and
see what the greater world has to offer.

13:55.270 --> 13:58.890
Sure, there's nothing wrong with devoting yourself to solo research in your room,

13:58.890 --> 14:02.810
but I think this is a good
opportunity to meet lots of people,

14:02.810 --> 14:06.540
be stimulated by them,
and gain deeper insights.

14:06.900 --> 14:09.550
Maybe I'm just being selfish.

14:10.620 --> 14:12.170
<i>Man...</i>

14:12.170 --> 14:16.420
<i>Dad really has done so much for me,
like when he took me in.</i>

14:17.480 --> 14:19.740
It would cause problems if we refused, right?

14:20.120 --> 14:21.170
You could say that.

14:22.600 --> 14:24.980
All right. I'll go.

14:24.980 --> 14:26.230
Thank you.

14:26.950 --> 14:28.090
Oh, right.

14:28.090 --> 14:32.270
You should take an attendant, so you
can devote yourself to your studies.

14:32.270 --> 14:34.840
An attendant? To take care of me?

14:34.840 --> 14:36.360
I don't need one.

14:36.360 --> 14:39.180
Living alone in an unfamiliar
place won't be easy.

14:39.180 --> 14:40.380
You think?

14:41.160 --> 14:43.080
Hmm, an attendant...

14:43.870 --> 14:45.440
An attendant, you say.

14:45.440 --> 14:46.870
You can't take Flay.

14:46.870 --> 14:48.270
Figures.

14:48.270 --> 14:51.500
<i>If I brought her along,
she would only cause problems.</i>

14:50.030 --> 14:50.740
Master!!

14:50.030 --> 14:51.250
M-Master!

14:51.500 --> 14:53.510
I'll prepare a number of candidates.

14:53.510 --> 14:54.520
Well...

14:54.520 --> 14:57.490
<i>I can't deal with suddenly
living with a stranger.</i>

14:57.850 --> 15:00.670
<i>That said, I can't think of anyone else...</i>

15:01.640 --> 15:03.710
It sounds like you're in need!

15:03.710 --> 15:05.080
Here, here!

15:05.080 --> 15:07.110
How about me?

15:07.110 --> 15:09.130
<i>Wait, you were listening in on us?!</i>

15:09.130 --> 15:11.290
Three meals a day and cuddling you to sleep!

15:11.290 --> 15:13.420
I can handle anything when it
comes to taking care of you!

15:13.780 --> 15:15.810
Experienced at changing diapers!

15:15.810 --> 15:17.650
I'm confident in my abilities!

15:18.250 --> 15:20.540
No, I don't think so...

15:19.890 --> 15:21.060
<b>Shock</b>

15:21.510 --> 15:23.210
Wh-Why not?

15:23.210 --> 15:26.410
I don't think anyone would
take their mom with them.

15:26.410 --> 15:27.180
What?

15:27.810 --> 15:30.850
Well, there's still three
months until you enroll.

15:30.850 --> 15:32.720
Find someone by then.

15:32.720 --> 15:33.480
Yes.

15:34.600 --> 15:37.870
<i>Well, I may have committed to going,</i>

15:37.870 --> 15:40.640
<i>but I won't be actually attending so easily.</i>

15:41.100 --> 15:45.210
<i>I call it, "Operation Make
Sure I Don't Go to School"!</i>

15:47.050 --> 15:48.210
Mm-hmm.

15:48.210 --> 15:51.040
I see, me going to school.

15:51.040 --> 15:52.620
Okay, okay.

15:53.270 --> 15:55.190
All right, leave it to me!

15:55.190 --> 15:58.130
This is what I was made to do!

15:58.970 --> 16:00.850
Did you think that's what I'd say?

16:00.850 --> 16:02.320
Of course I'm going to say no.

16:02.610 --> 16:03.970
<i>Knew it.</i>

16:03.970 --> 16:08.490
Well, since you're me,
you must know what I'm thinking.

16:08.690 --> 16:12.240
<b>Thuk</b>

16:09.440 --> 16:12.240
<b>Thuk</b>

16:10.190 --> 16:12.240
<b>Thuk</b>

16:10.940 --> 16:12.240
<b>D
I
N
G</b>

16:12.250 --> 16:14.640
I'm a copy, so I can't use magic.

16:14.640 --> 16:19.320
Which means you want to make
them expel me for being useless?

16:19.320 --> 16:21.820
You got it, me! You catch on quick.

16:22.080 --> 16:25.900
But it needs to be expulsion
based on the lack of ability.

16:25.900 --> 16:28.620
Anything else would cause trouble for Dad.

16:29.070 --> 16:32.460
So the plan is to put the blame on the king,

16:32.460 --> 16:37.000
for misjudging Haruto Zenfis's
abilities and recommending him.

16:38.010 --> 16:38.810
Seems to me...

16:39.320 --> 16:41.030
<i>you</i> could pull that off, too.

16:41.770 --> 16:45.620
Ah, well, I still have my barrier magic.

16:45.620 --> 16:49.900
If I somehow end up in a fight with
delinquents, I might just end up using it.

16:54.020 --> 16:56.960
So you're saying it's
fine if they beat <i>me</i> up?!

16:56.240 --> 16:57.450
Tsk, I'm too smart

16:57.780 --> 17:01.010
Well, even if anything
were to happen to you...

17:01.820 --> 17:03.510
I have plenty of replacements ready to go.

17:03.510 --> 17:04.080
What?!

17:04.420 --> 17:06.240
I knew it!

17:06.240 --> 17:08.610
How many of me have there been before?!

17:08.960 --> 17:10.270
I'm kidding.

17:10.270 --> 17:12.590
Char wouldn't let me go through with that.

17:12.920 --> 17:16.190
Don't you feel sorry for the other Haruto?

17:16.980 --> 17:19.600
So you did consider it, then.

17:20.710 --> 17:22.370
I've had it up to here!

17:22.370 --> 17:26.170
I don't wanna be this guy's copy!

17:25.630 --> 17:27.930
<i>This is what I'd be like if
I had a mental breakdown?</i>

17:26.170 --> 17:29.820
No, no, no, no!

17:28.660 --> 17:29.820
Hey, calm d—

17:29.820 --> 17:30.760
Shut up!

17:31.470 --> 17:32.820
Okay.

17:32.820 --> 17:36.160
I'll use a barrier to make
sure you don't get hurt.

17:36.560 --> 17:39.600
But that means you have
to carry out this mission.

17:39.600 --> 17:41.530
I'm not backing down on that one.

17:41.870 --> 17:43.620
Siiiiiiigh

17:44.090 --> 17:48.720
No matter what I do, I can't escape
the fact that I'm your copy.

17:49.000 --> 17:52.010
I want to enjoy the shut-in life, too!

17:52.010 --> 17:53.970
It's all for that!

17:53.970 --> 17:55.120
I have no choice...

17:55.810 --> 17:57.020
It's in your hands.

18:00.940 --> 18:02.000
Yeah.

18:03.760 --> 18:06.390
Okay, it's a deal.

19:39.080 --> 19:44.080
<i>This is a lakeside log house, a mountain's
distance away from the castle.</i>

19:44.520 --> 19:48.680
<i>I spent five years building it
as my final shut-in destination.</i>

19:49.630 --> 19:51.780
<i>This place really is so nice.</i>

19:51.780 --> 19:54.870
<i>Unlike the castle, no one
will interrupt me here.</i>

19:56.330 --> 19:58.220
Oh! Level up!

19:58.630 --> 20:02.030
<i>All the time in the world, with just
me and my homemade handheld console...</i>

20:02.460 --> 20:03.770
<i>This rules!</i>

20:05.680 --> 20:07.060
Haruto!

20:07.060 --> 20:08.850
I came over to watch some anime!

20:09.230 --> 20:12.010
<i>Well, this still happens, though.</i>

20:12.010 --> 20:13.630
S-Sure.

20:18.130 --> 20:19.630
<i>Now's our chance!</i>

20:19.630 --> 20:21.820
<i>Love Cure Cure!</i>

20:24.560 --> 20:26.320
I'll send you to eternal sleep!

20:26.320 --> 20:32.780
Marvelous Pretty Love and
Peace Death Explosion!

20:34.250 --> 20:37.670
Another awesome episode of
<i>Tiny★Love Cure</i> this week.

20:37.670 --> 20:41.430
You stopped coming to my room to watch
it, so I thought you'd gotten over it.

20:41.740 --> 20:44.880
Actually, I've been taking more lessons,

20:44.880 --> 20:49.370
and I was told I should stop
going to your room all the time.

20:49.370 --> 20:52.850
<i>Is that their roundabout way of telling
her to stop clinging to me so much?</i>

20:53.270 --> 20:55.350
<b>Dejected</b>

20:53.290 --> 20:56.690
I can't come all the way
here unless I ask Flay...

20:56.690 --> 20:59.180
I want to watch more anime!

20:59.180 --> 21:02.470
I guess it is a pain in the butt to get here.

21:02.470 --> 21:05.670
I <i>could</i> use my magic to teleport you...

21:09.840 --> 21:10.870
Here we go.

21:10.870 --> 21:12.450
Yes, Haruto!

21:16.010 --> 21:17.420
That's amazing!

21:17.420 --> 21:18.760
Impressive, my master.

21:19.200 --> 21:22.520
I've tested it out to make sure
it's safe over long distances,

21:22.520 --> 21:24.500
but there's one problem.

21:24.990 --> 21:27.340
I've never tried it with a living creature.

21:27.340 --> 21:31.050
Why don't you use your copy, then?

21:31.380 --> 21:33.560
You sure can be ruthless sometimes.

21:33.560 --> 21:37.270
Wasn't he created to be of use to you?

21:39.660 --> 21:41.740
Guess I'll try it out, then.

21:41.980 --> 21:42.700
Hey.

21:43.510 --> 21:45.280
Oh, it's just me.

21:45.280 --> 21:47.730
Can you come over here by
going through this thing?

21:48.610 --> 21:49.460
Huh?

21:49.730 --> 21:52.270
Did you really think I wouldn't catch on?

21:52.270 --> 21:54.160
Don't treat me like your lab rat.

21:54.160 --> 21:55.280
Shut up and get over here.

21:55.280 --> 21:56.790
Why don't <i>you</i> get over <i>here</i>?

21:59.020 --> 22:00.180
What's wrong?

22:00.180 --> 22:01.460
What are you scared of?

22:01.850 --> 22:04.830
It's clear as day what you're thinking.

22:04.830 --> 22:08.120
You're scared of messing up and getting
stuck in that dimension, right?

22:08.140 --> 22:09.350
<b>Annoyed</b>

22:09.350 --> 22:11.740
Too scared to put your own life on the line?

22:09.350 --> 22:14.060
<b>Mwahaha</b>

22:11.740 --> 22:14.070
Cat's out of the bag, original me!

22:14.060 --> 22:15.810
<b>Mwahaha</b>

22:14.070 --> 22:15.580
He really pisses me off!

22:16.320 --> 22:17.580
You think I'm scared?

22:18.110 --> 22:19.380
What if I do <i>this</i>?!

22:20.280 --> 22:21.000
Flay?!

22:21.000 --> 22:22.700
How dare you?!

22:23.530 --> 22:27.250
And you think you're fit to
stand in for Lord Haruto?!

22:27.250 --> 22:28.420
Take this!

22:29.200 --> 22:31.160
<b>Blargh</b>

22:32.480 --> 22:34.080
You're something else.

22:34.080 --> 22:35.290
I'm honored.

22:35.640 --> 22:39.100
Are you okay, copy Haruto?

22:39.100 --> 22:42.140
Oh, what do I see but an angel?

22:42.140 --> 22:43.640
I'm a magical girl, actually.

22:43.640 --> 22:47.570
Lord Haruto, this means the
experiment was a success.

22:43.670 --> 22:46.090
This... is really giving
me mixed feelings

22:47.570 --> 22:49.820
Yeah. Now all that's left is...

22:52.210 --> 22:55.910
Okay. Now you can come and go
between here and the castle.

23:01.250 --> 23:02.690
Oh, right.

23:02.690 --> 23:04.900
I forgot...

23:02.690 --> 23:05.000
I need to find an attendant.

23:06.070 --> 23:07.280
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

23:08.950 --> 23:23.960
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102 22 l 0 22

23:08.950 --> 23:23.960
Episode Preview

23:09.620 --> 23:11.250
Charlotte here!

23:11.250 --> 23:14.450
I was busy this week playing
in the snow and watching anime!

23:14.450 --> 23:17.240
You can't skip anime, or else you
might miss out on an awesome episode!

23:15.830 --> 23:17.250
<b>Staaaare</b>

23:17.240 --> 23:19.580
Next episode:
"I Need to Find an Attendant...!"

23:18.040 --> 23:23.950
<b>I Need to Find an Attendant...!</b>

23:19.580 --> 23:22.780
Is Haruto is worried about something?
